        "AbstractText": "In order to keep the interventional community up-to-date with the overwhelming amount of new data, we have selected where we believe to be the most important publications in percutaneous coronary intervention from January 1, 2015 to mid-November 2015. We hope that this will serve as an important overview of 2015, and ongoing reference for future years."
